---Check whether an asset ID is available before choosing it.
---Requires: No capability; the referenced owner must be your mod or a dependency.
---When: Entrypoint or a callback.
---Returns: `true` if the asset is described by the resolver, otherwise `false`. It does not guarantee successful image decoding or that the asset has the type you want. Malformed or unauthorized references raise an error.
---[Full reference](https://dawc17.github.io/ProjectEclipse/api/assets/#sf2assetsexists)
---@param reference string
---@return boolean
function assets.exists(reference) end

